##
A project that says something a project cannot say.

The whole vocabulary is 'project', 'source', 'end project', and both comment forms:
'comment' to the end of a line, or 'comment begin' closed by 'end comment'. A project file
describes a build, not a computation, so it borrows nothing else from the language.
##

project Unknown
    include ../runtime/overflow.pc
    reference SomeLibrary
end project
